Homepage: https://omaxian.org
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: omaxian-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nexussfan-archive-keyring, sysvinit-core, eudev, elogind, libpam-elogind, ca-certificates
Description: Omaxian OS base configuration
 Apt sources (Devuan Excalibur + backports, XLibre, apt.omaxian.org),
 apt pinning (backports kernel/PipeWire/Quickshell; systemd, PulseAudio,
 Xorg server, Firefox and default games blocked), keyrings, GRUB
 distributor name, per-model kernel options from SMBIOS (GRUB), a kernel
 hardening sysctl, sysvinit scripts for thermald, iio-sensor-proxy,
 switcheroo-control and boltd, a udev rule for ipp-usb, and
 /etc/omaxian-release.
